  "title": "Minecraft but Taking Damage Deletes the Chunk",
  "description": "Taking damage will delete the chunk you are in.",
  "body": "![Villager house surrounded by several missing chunks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9b519eebb7d1863238c1434e3be6e4efcd994f70_0.webp)\n\n## Overview\nEvery time you take damage the chunk you're in will delete itself after a delay. That's pretty much the gist of it.\n\nIf you'd like to make a video or content using this pack, go for it! If you do so, you must provide credit to me (Ambiguous Chameleon) and provide a link to this pack in the description and/or comments. Thank you!\n\n## Cheats & Commands\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">Command</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.toggle_mode</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Changes chunk deletion mode<sup>1</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.toggle_instant</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Toggles whether chunks disappear instantly, or with countdown<sup>2</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.random_distance</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Max distance a random chunk can be selected for deletion<sup>3</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.set_block</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Chunks will be filled with block in mainhand<sup>4</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/function ac_cheat:uninstall</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Uninstall project (data pack version only!)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<sup>1</sup> Normal: Default setting; Random: When taking damage a random nearby chunk gets deleted\n\n<sup>2</sup> By default it uses a countdown\n\n<sup>3</sup> This pertains to if chunk mode is set to random. Default is 30 blocks\n\n<sup>4</sup> Air is used by default. If nothing is held in hand, chunks revert back to filling with air\n\n## Cool people!\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/EpiJLi8pppw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/rMQvY-Fcc4A\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/q-BkLHNSoD4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/r2gW0_gzeJ4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oBkhXP6Nk38\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/CrlMzB20sdM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/L9SLF3gBzYg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/qvjKVXsqNO8\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/nBkwhmSJ9nQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/MfRTqcxLg50\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>",
